Animate←{
   ⍝ Writes SVG frames for an animation, one per day, to directory ⍵,
   ⍝ which must exist, as frame_00001.svg through frame_NNNNN.svg
   ⍝ ⍺ is (M D Y)(M D Y) TIME LAT LONG: start date, end date, UTC time,
   ⍝ latitude and longitude
    start end t lat long←⍺
    days←(Jnu start)+¯1+⍳1+(Jnu end)-Jnu start
    file←{⍵,'/frame_',(¯5↑'00000',⍕⍺),'.svg'}
    dir←⍵
    _←(⍳≢days){(⊂FrameSvg SkyAt ⍵ t lat long)⎕NPUT(⍺ file dir)1}¨days
    1:_←⎕←'Generated ',(⍕≢days),' frames in ',⍵ }
